WEBVTT

00:11:27.933 --> 00:11:30.144
I talked to her on the phone
a couple of times,

00:11:30.144 --> 00:11:31.937
and I knew she adored Jimmy.

00:11:31.979 --> 00:11:34.398
This made sense
because Jimmy was her baby.

00:11:34.398 --> 00:11:36.692
He was the youngest of her five children

00:11:36.692 --> 00:11:38.902
and the only boy in that house.

00:11:38.944 --> 00:11:41.822
She certainly would have helped Jimmy
if he turned to her,

00:11:41.864 --> 00:11:43.532
and she did often.

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:47.995
But Jimmy told me that her landlord
started asking questions.

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:51.415
He saw Jimmy making his way
around the building

00:11:51.457 --> 00:11:53.125
and he didn't want any trouble.

00:11:54.084 --> 00:11:57.296
Thousands of families
have been evicted from their homes

00:11:57.296 --> 00:12:01.008
for the crime of letting a loved one
sleep on the couch.